{"agent":"ps-snapcal","data":{"body":"Fixes bug B02eb853b9d: When another lease overlaps the requested globs, CLI `ddflow update ID --globs ...` prints ok and exits 0 though the lease is unchanged and the request is only queued as waiting (MCP says refused, exit 3). Probe: ddflow update PS-snapshot-calibrate --globs \"...,ddflow/config_sections/log.py\" while PS-evidence-inline holds it -> exit 0; the later commit is refused for log.py. Found on PS-snapshot-calibrate.\n\nWrite the regression test first and watch it FAIL on the unfixed code; then `ddflow complete fix-B02eb853b9d --regression-test <test>` closes the bug with the task (or `ddflow bug fixed B02eb853b9d --regression-test <test>` first).","fixes":["B02eb853b9d"],"globs":["ddflow/config_sections/log.py","ddflow/config_sections/log.py","tests/compat/test_surface.py","tests/test_architecture_counters.py","tests/test_architecture_guards.py","tests/test_architecture_import_contracts.py","tests/test_cmdrunner_callsites.py","tests/test_fsio_log.py","tests/test_infra_log_split.py","tests/test_local_config_surfaces.py","tests/test_log_blobs.py","tests/test_log_lamport_merge.py","tests/test_log_line_separators.py","tests/test_log_mark.py","tests/test_log_merged_order.py","tests/test_log_read_cache_ceiling.py","tests/test_log_read_cache_config.py","tests/test_log_read_cache_datawrites.py","tests/test_log_read_cache_reads.py","tests/test_log_redaction_all_kinds.py","tests/test_log_redaction_lookups.py","tests/test_log_scale.py","tests/test_log_snapshot.py","tests/test_log_snapshot_knobs.py","tests/test_log_torn_tail.py","tests/test_merge_queue_ci_log.py","tests/test_upgrade_dry_run_log.py","tests/test_view_log.py"],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"bugs-2","priority":10,"tags":["bugfix"],"title":"Fix bug B02eb853b9d: ddflow update --globs prints ok and exits 0 while only queueing a waiting request"},"id":"e3d16634916502ae713879192","kind":"task.added","lamport":135677,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B02eb853b9d","ts":"2026-11