{"agent":"ps-snapcal","data":{"body":"Fixes bug B2880a1fc44: On clean main, tests/test_upgrade_manifest.py, test_upgrade_manifest_lint.py and test_upgrade_on_start.py fail (19 failures, same set with and without PS-snapshot-calibrate). test_upgrade_manifest names locks.probe, locks.probe_at, locks.probe_merge_tree_min_git and locks.probe_timeout_s as not announced under ddflow/templates/upgrade/unreleased; a second failure is a why cut mid-sentence for 0.2.6 lessons.test_file_globs. Probe: uv run pytest tests/test_upgrade_manifest.py -q. Belongs to LK-conflict-probe. Found on PS-snapshot-calibrate.\n\nWrite the regression test first and watch it FAIL on the unfixed code; then `ddflow complete fix-B2880a1fc44 --regression-test <test>` closes the bug with the task (or `ddflow bug fixed B2880a1fc44 --regression-test <test>` first).","fixes":["B2880a1fc44"],"globs":["tests/test_upgrade_manifest_lint.py","tests/test_upgrade_on_start.py","tests/test_upgrade_manifest.py"],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"bugs-2","priority":10,"tags":["bugfix"],"title":"Fix bug B2880a1fc44: main is red: upgrade-manifest tests fail, locks.probe* knobs not announced (LK-conflict-probe)"},"id":"e4d2c08827119ad472d1e9707","kind":"task.added","lamport":135680,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B2880a1fc44","ts":"2026-11-04T17:47:06.189905Z"}
